Server init.
>> a := Blob gishya: 4.
a bytes: ( Urutonde gishya ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob gishya: 4.
b bytes: ( Urutonde gishya ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a gishya.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Ibisohoka andika: ( a ^ c ), umurongo-mushya. } fata-ikosa: { :e Ibisohoka andika: e, umurongo-mushya. }, tangira.
a rekura.
b rekura.
